{"actions":[],"cardId":"cardid_b6a26f756709da32804e60fd462a1101","createdAt":"2026-03-20T02:36:17Z","expiresAt":"2026-03-22T02:36:17Z","icon":"square.grid.2x2","id":"card_935b8736d5930344a9de2f060ae1ef1c","message":"Your 39-file MRBD patch landed today. Meanwhile, Apple quietly hit an AI revenue milestone and Europe unveiled a new framework to rival Delaware incorporation.","metadata":{"height":620,"htmlContent":"<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><meta name='color-scheme' content='light dark'><style>:root{--bg:var(--fw-bg,#ffffff);--text:var(--fw-text,#111827);--muted:var(--fw-text-secondary,#6b7280);--tertiary:var(--fw-text-tertiary,#9ca3af);--border:var(--fw-border,rgba(15,23,42,0.08));--accent:var(--fw-accent,#2563eb);--surface:var(--fw-surface,#f3f4f6)}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--bg:var(--fw-bg,#1c1c1e);--text:var(--fw-text,#f2f2f7);--muted:var(--fw-text-secondary,#a0a0a0);--tertiary:var(--fw-text-tertiary,#707070);--border:var(--fw-border,rgba(255,255,255,0.1));--accent:var(--fw-accent,#4b93ff);--surface:var(--fw-surface,#2a2a2a)}}body{margin:0;padding:20px;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--text);background:var(--bg)}*{box-sizing:border-box}h4{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 4px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3}.subtitle{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.4}.divider{border:none;border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin:0}.date{font-size:13px;color:var(--tertiary);margin:0 0 12px}.story{display:flex;gap:12px;padding:14px 0}.story-text{flex:1;min-width:0}.story-headline{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 4px}.story-summary{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px}.story-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:11px;color:var(--tertiary)}.story-category{background:var(--border);padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-weight:500;font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.03em}.story-img{width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:10px;object-fit:cover;background:var(--border);flex-shrink:0}</style></head><body><div class='date'>Mar 19 Thursday</div><h4>MRBD D-pad fix ships, Apple crosses $1B in AI revenue</h4><div class='subtitle'>Your 39-file MRBD patch landed today. Meanwhile Apple quietly hit an AI milestone and Europe unveiled a Delaware rival.</div><hr class='divider'><div class='story'><div class='story-text'><div class='story-headline'>39 MRBD game files patched for D-pad capture</div><div class='story-summary'>You added capture-phase keydown listeners with tabindex and auto-focus across every HTML file. Arrow keys and Enter should now work on the glasses — the browser's spatial navigation was eating events before your handlers fired.</div><div class='story-meta'><span class='story-category'>Your work</span><span>· Tonight</span></div></div><img class='story-img' src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633356122544-f134324a6cee?w=160&h=160&fit=crop' alt='Code' onerror=\"this.style.background='var(--surface)';this.alt=''\"></div><hr class='divider'><div class='story'><div class='story-text'><div class='story-headline'>Apple set to pass $1B in AI-related revenue this year</div><div class='story-summary'>Apple is monetizing AI through subscriptions and ecosystem lock-in rather than massive infra spend. Q1 2026 Services revenue hit $143.76B (+15.6% YoY). The market is shifting focus from Apple's tech gap to its margin advantage.</div><div class='story-meta'><span class='story-category'>Big Tech</span><span>· AlphaPilot · Mar 19</span></div></div><img class='story-img' src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611532736597-de2d4265fba3?w=160&h=160&fit=crop' alt='Apple' onerror=\"this.style.background='var(--surface)';this.alt=''\"></div><hr class='divider'><div class='story'><div class='story-text'><div class='story-headline'>EU Inc: 48-hour company formation across 27 states</div><div class='story-summary'>The European Commission unveiled \"EU Inc\" on Mar 17 — a single optional legal form for startups. Digital registration under €100, no minimum share capital. Designed to stop European founders from incorporating in Delaware.</div><div class='story-meta'><span class='story-category'>Policy</span><span>· EU Commission · Mar 17</span></div></div><img class='story-img' src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519389950473-47ba0277781c?w=160&h=160&fit=crop' alt='EU' onerror=\"this.style.background='var(--surface)';this.alt=''\"></div></body></html>"},"priority":"medium","state":"active","subType":"briefing","subtitle":"MRBD D-pad fix ships, Apple crosses $1B in AI revenue, and the EU wants to create startups in 48 hours","timestamp":"2026-03-20T02:36:17Z","title":"Thursday evening briefing","type":"html-webview"}
